{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S08、S11、S12等短停留段仍有较多较长的感受句，临时扫读不如Y右栏的短词直接利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的话语重点有明显的视觉锚点，感受又有一部分随音乐节点出现，观众更容易跟着音乐逐步接收信息，而不是面对一堆同时出现的感受标签。Y的叙事更口语化，人物行为的动机和因果关系交代得更直接，但右栏短词有时堆积过多，尤其S03，容易看见许多感受却分不清它们的先后与变化。X在情绪层次、身体反应和音乐细节上的表达明显更细腻，前后反复出现的亲近、孤独、犹疑与重新站稳也形成了更完整的情感脉络。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "71c955ad-3073-4969-b7e7-4230a04e4978", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T041224072148Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:13:28.331778+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5556ab3d19cbfd183945dc5030db829ec57578e2f763b43bf60aba58450b8db3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g